/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Personal Claude Code overrides. .claude/settings.json is committed and shared;
# this is the per-developer counterpart and must not be.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Secrets. Never commit these; .dockerignore excludes them from image layers too.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Coverage artefacts from `cargo llvm-cov`.
*.profraw
*.profdata
/lcov.info

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored — see the note in README.md.
